9. **status**: Status code (16#0000 success, 16#8200 window length error)

Key behaviors:
- Need to maintain a buffer/array of values to calculate moving average
- Need to track the sum of values in the window
- Need to detect rising edge on trigger
- Need to handle reset functionality
- Need to validate windowSize (1-100)

Implementation approach:
- Use an array to store the values in the window
- Keep track of the current sum
- Keep track of the current count of valid values
- On each trigger (cyclicExecution or rising edge of trigger), add new value, subtract oldest if window is full
- Calculate average = sum / count

